==English==

===Etymology===
Occupational surname borrowed from {{bor|en|de|Hauer||hewer, miner}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|Hauers}}

# {{surname|en|from=German}}.

====Statistics====
* According to the 2010 United States Census, ''Hauer'' is the 10332<sup>nd</sup> most common surname in the United States, belonging to 3118 individuals. ''Hauer'' is most common among White (92.37%) individuals.

